// ---- Interop Lesson 9: interop-smart-fhir
const SMARTORIG = 'Mandel JC, Kreda DA, Mandl KD, Kohane IS, Ramoni RB, "SMART on FHIR: a standards-based, interoperable apps platform for electronic health records," JAMIA 2016;23(5):899-908: SMART began in 2010 under an ONC SHARP grant with Kenneth Mandl and Isaac Kohane as principal investigators; Josh Mandel was lead architect. CDS Hooks is now an HL7 standard (cds-hooks.hl7.org).';
